| Module | Title | Time | What You'll Learn/Build |
|--------|-------|------|-------------------------|
| 0 | [Architecture & Technologies](./architecture-and-technologies) | 45-60 min | Stack deep-dive (Next.js, Better Auth, Drizzle), monorepo navigation |
| 1 | [Setup & Configuration](./setup-and-configuration) | 30 min | Running app configured for B2B mode |
| 2 | [Branding](./branding) | 1 hr | Customize your app's branding |
| 3 | [Data Model & First Feature](./data-model-and-first-feature) | 2-3 hrs | Database schemas, server actions, feedback boards with CRUD |
| 4 | [Feedback Items](./feedback-items) | 2-3 hrs | Feedback submission, voting, status workflow, filtering |
| 5 | [Public Boards](./public-boards) | 1 hr | Public routes, anonymous submission, rate limiting, SEO |
| 6 | [Authentication](./authentication) | 1 hr | Google OAuth setup, auth hooks, post-auth flow |
| 7 | [Organizations & Teams](./organizations-and-teams) | 1 hr | Multi-tenancy, invitations, TeamPulse-specific permissions |
| 8 | [Billing & Subscriptions](./billing-and-subscriptions) | 1-2 hrs | Plan limits, gating boards/feedback, usage dashboard |
| 9 | [Email & Notifications](./email-and-notifications) | 45 min | React Email templates, feedback notifications |
| 10 | [Settings & Profile](./settings-and-profile) | 30 min | Account settings, profile management |
| 11 | [Admin Dashboard](./admin-dashboard) | 45 min | User management, metrics, impersonation, banning |
| 12 | [Production Readiness](./production-readiness) | 1 hr | Environment config, security checklist, deployment |

